cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "llm-privacy-gateway: a fail-closed privacy gateway for LLM requests with a measured PII-detection benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: Echchakar
    given-names: Haitam
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/echchakarhaitam-cyber/llm-privacy-gateway"
url: "https://github.com/echchakarhaitam-cyber/llm-privacy-gateway"
abstract: >-
  Research software that measures how well regex, spaCy, Presidio and trained CRF detectors find
  personal data in text, implements masking strategies and a reversible mapping, and provides a
  fail-closed HTTP gateway that screens text before it may reach an external language model.
  Evaluated on synthetic public datasets only.
keywords:
  - pii
  - privacy
  - llm
  - gateway
  - named-entity-recognition
  - crf
  - presidio
  - spacy
  - reproducible-research
